# Backend Spring Rules

## Stack

- Spring Boot, JPA/Hibernate, PostgreSQL
- JWT auth for `/api/admin/*`
- Public read-only: `/api/public/portfolio`, `/api/public/health`
- Config via `.env` + `application-{dev,prod}.properties` with `${ENV_VAR}` placeholders

## Patterns

- Entities in `entity/`; controllers split: `PublicController`, `PortfolioController` (admin), `AuthController`
- CORS origins must include Vercel domains + localhost:4200/4201
- File uploads: `FileStorageService` → served at `/api/files/**`

## When changing API

1. Update Java entity/DTO
2. Sync `portfolio-frontend/src/app/portfolio/models/portfolio.models.ts`
3. Update `PortfolioDataService` mapping if field names differ
4. Test locally with dev profile before `deploy.bat`

## Deploy

- Production: port 8082, DB `portfolio_backend`, user `portfolio_user` on Oracle Cloud VM
- Only deploy backend when Java code changes
